% All four correlated manifestations observed, plus the independent finding.
% Flat encoding would give P ~= 0.98 (prior + 4x ln(LR) + family history).
% With the mechanism, the four count ONCE: P should be much lower / sensible.
observe creatine_kinase(markedly_elevated)
observe ck_rise(post_exertion)
observe symptom(exertional_cramps)
observe symptom(second_wind)
observe family_history(positive)
? diagnosis(mcardle)
